# TEST FIXTURE (id 221): the C6 world systems (contract section 46). Not part of the game: reached only by the host harness (tools/host_world, `make c6sys`).
#   * teleport pads: A (4,4) <-> B (18,4) and C (8,4) <-> D (17,6) inside a closed room (i 14..22, j 2..8: the person N (20,6) is reachable only through the pads: mapc follows them);
#     E (4,12) <-> F in test_c6sys_b (222)
#   * the card-key door K (12,11) in a closed corridor (i 8..16, j 11): the person beyond it (15,11) is reachable only through the door
#   * the gift choice: two creatures (24,14) and (26,14) share the flag gift_taken
@map test_c6sys
@size 32 22
@interior no
@bg 0
@fill dirt_a
@spawn start 2 9 SE
@spawn door 6 11 E
@spawn gifts 25 16 N
@spawn pads 6 6 S
@flag gift_taken 1005
@legend
  .  tile=dirt_a
  W  tile=dirt_a solid=yes
  P  tile=pad pad=yes
  K  tile=dirt_a keydoor=chip_acceso
  g  tile=dirt_a gift=embercub level=12 hide_flag=gift_taken
  G  tile=dirt_a gift=puddlet level=14 hide_flag=gift_taken
  N  tile=dirt_a npc=vecino text=c6sys.person face=S
  n  tile=dirt_a npc=vecino text=c6sys.person face=N
@pad 4 4 -> 18 4 face=S
@pad 18 4 -> 4 4 face=S
@pad 8 4 -> 17 6 face=S
@pad 17 6 -> 8 4 face=S
@pad 4 12 -> test_c6sys_b 9 5 face=S
@grid
